{
  "$schema": "./ROBOTICS_POLICY_CONTRACT.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "kind": "lds-consumer-policy-contract",
  "id": "robotics-navigation-marker-state-badge",
  "profile": "robotics-ui",
  "authority": "docs/NAVIGATION_EXPRESSION_CONVENTIONS.md",
  "owner": "LDS design system owner · Robotics domain engineering",
  "decision": {
    "maxVisibleBadges": 1,
    "visualStyle": "solid",
    "placement": "attached-top-right",
    "accessibleStateRetention": "all-raw-states",
    "renderers": {
      "WaypointMarker": {
        "bodyChannel": "availability",
        "badgePriority": ["invalid", "stale"]
      },
      "FacilityTransition": {
        "bodyChannel": "availability",
        "badgePriority": ["invalid", "stale", "unknown"]
      }
    }
  },
  "evidence": [
    {
      "root": "lds",
      "file": "docs/NAVIGATION_EXPRESSION_CONVENTIONS.md",
      "contains": [
        "최대 한 개의 우선순위 solid 배지",
        "Waypoint는 `invalid > stale`, FacilityTransition은 `invalid > stale > unknown`",
        "접근성 이름과 상세 데이터에는 모든 원시 상태를 유지"
      ],
      "excludes": ["offset 스택"]
    },
    {
      "root": "consumer",
      "file": "docs/NAVIGATION_EXPRESSION_CONVENTIONS.md",
      "contains": [
        "at most one prioritized solid badge",
        "Waypoint uses `invalid > stale`; FacilityTransition",
        "preserves every raw state.",
        "main LDS Navigation expression convention"
      ],
      "excludes": ["offset stack"]
    },
    {
      "root": "consumer",
      "file": "src/components/robotics/WaypointMarker.jsx",
      "contains": [
        "const statusBadgeKind = invalid",
        "data-waypoint-status-badge-style=\"solid\"",
        "without growing a badge stack"
      ]
    },
    {
      "root": "consumer",
      "file": "src/components/robotics/FacilityTransition.jsx",
      "contains": [
        "const stateBadge = invalid",
        "transition.availability === 'unknown'",
        "data-transition-status-badge-style=\"solid\"",
        "one attached solid status badge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "root": "consumer",
      "file": "stories/RoboticsFoundationStateBadge.stories.jsx",
      "contains": [
        "querySelectorAll('[data-waypoint-status-badge]').length !== 1",
        "Facility marker must resolve invalid > stale > unknown into one solid badge.",
        "compound waypoint accessible name is missing"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
